            "sid": "AMO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu aŋombi akuBashani awakaji mwekala kumpidi yaSamariya, mwakabishaŋa tuzweŋi, mwachikachikaŋa abula yuma, mwelaŋa anfumu jenu nenu, Letenu tunwi; tiyenu izu idi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nasanyiki kujila kwindi, nindi, Tiyenu, kwakayiwana mafuku akayitwalawu namalonda, niakwenu akashalaku akayitwala namayumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakedikila kumapana akumpwembu, mwakemakana wejima wenu iwu nahindi, iwu nahindi; akayinatila muHaramoni. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzenu kuBeteli mumotoki nshimbi; nikuGiligali muvulishi nyiloŋa; letenu yimuna yenu yakuketula habudidi habudidi, niyuma yenu yamwikumi, muhitaŋa mafuku asatu asatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lambulenu himulambu wakusakilila nachu wyuma yikweti iluŋi, bidikishenu nyilambu yakulambula chakunyichima yenu, muyishimwaŋeni; muloŋa chumichi chayitelela, enu anyana kaIsarela. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayinki kubula majilu kumaji munyikala yenu yejima, nikutonda yakudya mwejima mumwekalila. Hela chochu, himunafunti kudamuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayikwatilili nvula helili kunashali dehi tukweji tusatu nakwaŋula; nelili hamukala wumu ninokeshahu nvula, hamukala wukwawu kunokeshahu nvula nehi; ihidi hanokela nvula, iha di kwawu nvula kunokelahu nehi, dilepuka nilepu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nyikala yiyedi, hela yisatu, hiyi kuya nakululuta kumukala wumu nawu anwi meji, mpwila kuketuka nehi. Hela chochu, himunafunti kudamuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
