          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, wawumbaŋa mapidi, waleŋaŋa mpepela, walejaŋa muntu chuma chadi nakutoŋojokayi, wabalumunaŋa budidi hiyikwikala mwidima, wadatolaŋa hayinaŋanaŋa yahamaseki, ijina dindi diyi Yehova, Nzambi wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
